# Copy to .env (git-ignored). Vite only exposes variables prefixed VITE_.
#
# Every name here is one the app actually reads. The previous version of this file
# documented VITE_SOLANA_RPC_URL, which nothing reads - setting it changed nothing and
# left you silently on the public devnet endpoint.

# Backend API. Defaults to the deployed worker, so the frontend works against production
# out of the box; point it at http://localhost:8787 to develop against a local one.
# VITE_API_BASE="http://localhost:8787"

# Solana RPC for wallet connections and transaction sends.
# Defaults to https://api.devnet.solana.com, which rate-limits.
# VITE_SOLANA_RPC="https://devnet.helius-rpc.com/?api-key=YOUR_HELIUS_API_KEY_HERE"

# Base Sepolia RPC for wagmi. Defaults to the public endpoint.
# VITE_BASE_SEPOLIA_RPC="https://sepolia.base.org"
